# Homeschool Study

A homeschool-first study and mastery app focused on helping children learn through active recall, especially spoken answers.

## Current Phase

**V0.1 — Voice Proof of Concept**

The goal of this version is to prove the core study loop:

1. Show a question
2. Record a spoken answer
3. Transcribe the answer
4. Grade the response
5. Give immediate feedback
6. Update a simple mastery score

## V0.1 Scope

This version is intentionally small.

It currently focuses on:

- One child
- Hard-coded study questions
- Browser-based microphone recording
- Speech-to-text transcription
- Simple answer grading
- Immediate feedback
- Basic mastery scoring
- Lightweight private access to protect AI usage

## Not Included Yet

The following are intentionally postponed until later phases:

- Full parent accounts
- Child profiles
- Curriculum importing
- Spaced repetition
- Parent dashboards
- Cloud syncing
- Subscriptions
- Screen-time controls
- Full production authentication

## Development Direction

V0.1 is being built as a browser-based web app so the voice-powered study experience can be validated without requiring Mac/Xcode development.

The long-term production platform will be decided after the core learning experience is proven.

## Product Goal

Make homeschool review easier for parents and more independent, effective, and engaging for children.
